## Session Protocol

Follow the `lean-econ-workflow` skill (START/RUN/END). Each phase ends with: green
`lake build` (nonzero job count), 0 new sorries, `#print axioms` on the phase's
headline result(s) (target: `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]` only unless
the project has a documented reason for more), `memory.md`/`progress.md` updated,
a `phase(N): ...` commit.

